# What this file does
#   Keeps local-only files out of the container build (installed packages, build output, local data and secrets).
#
# Why it exists
#   Without it, COPY . . in the Dockerfile would copy a local .env and the embedded database into the image,
#   and a Windows node_modules folder would overwrite the Linux packages that npm ci installed.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.data
apps/api/.env
.git
.github
.githooks
**/*.log
**/__pycache__
